# Named owner per module (CS5013 project guide, section 10).
#
# Even Hand is one end-to-end system, built and delivered as a single pipeline:
# a course enters at eh-ingest and leaves as a report from eh-report, and
# `mvnw verify` builds and tests all of it. Each module has one named owner, who
# reviews every change to it first; the design document's module table lists the
# same owners.
#
# Both of us review the other's code weekly from week one, because the viva
# examines each of us on the whole system rather than on a share of it.

